inas), C\/M\/Y (BTD180CMY: 5.000 p\u00e1ginas)<\/li>  <li><b>Contenido de la caja:<\/b> Cable de alimentaci\u00f3n, Gu\u00eda de configuraci\u00f3n r\u00e1pida, Garant\u00eda, Equipo, Consumibles<\/li>  <li><b>Dimensiones con caja (mm):<\/b> 461 \u00d7 218 \u00d7 501<\/li>  <li><b>Dimensiones sin caja (mm):<\/b> 390 \u00d7 343 \u00d7 149<\/li>  <li><b>Peso sin caja:<\/b> 6.5 kg<\/li>  <li><b>Volumen mensual recomendado:<\/b> Hasta 1.000 p\u00e1ginas<\/li>  <li><b>Requisitos de energ\u00eda:<\/b> AC 220-240V, 50\/60Hz<\/li>  <li><b>Consumo energ\u00e9tico:<\/b> Copia (16 W), Preparado (2,5 W), Reposo (0,6 W), Apagado (0,15 W)<\/li>  <li><b>Nivel de ruido:<\/b> 56 dB(A)<\/li>  <li><b>Temperatura de funcionamiento:<\/b> 10-35 \u00b0C \/ Humedad 20-80 %<\/li>  <li><b>Temperatura de almacenamiento:<\/b> 0-40 \u00b0C \/ Humedad 20-80 %<\/li>  <li><b>Interfaz local:<\/b> Hi-Speed USB 2.0<\/li>  <li><b>Red inal\u00e1mbrica:<\/b> 2.4 GHz (IEEE 802.11 b\/g\/n), 5 GHz (IEEE 802.11a\/n)<\/li>  <li><b>Conectividad m\u00f3vil:<\/b> Brother Mobile Connect, Apple AirPrint, Mopria, Brother Apps, Web Connect<\/li>  <li><b>Seguridad:<\/b> Actualizaci\u00f3n de firmware, control de acceso, impresi\u00f3n segura, firmware firmado, Secure Boot<\/li>  <li><b>Seguridad Wi-Fi:<\/b> WPA-PSK, WPA2-PSK, WPA3-SAE, SSL\/TLS, WEP 64\/128 bit<\/li>  <li><b>Compatibilidad IPv4:<\/b> ARP, DHCP, DNS, HTTP Server, IPP, SNMP, mDNS, ICMP<\/li>  <li><b>Compatibilidad IPv6:<\/b> NDP, RA, ICMPv6, HTTP Server, IPP, SNMPv3<\/li><\/ul>","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description_short":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_description":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_keywords":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_title":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"link_rewrite":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"visibility":"both","manufacturer_name":"BROTHER","supplier":null,"width":null,"height":null,"depth":null,"weight":0,"unit_price":184.35,"unit_price_tax":184.35,"tax_rules_group":null,"category":"Multifunciones  e Impresoras",